This archive was created by extracting hw-gnueabihf from test_read_format_7zip_lzma2_arm.7z.uu
and then creating the archive with 7zip 26.02:

rm -f libarchive/test/test_read_format_7zip_lzma1_arm.7z
7z a -m0=ARM -m1=LZMA -mhc=off -mtm=off libarchive/test/test_read_format_7zip_lzma1_arm.7z hw-gnueabihf -y

-mtm=off keeps the result reproducible: without it the stored mtime
changes on every regeneration. The test does not check the mtime.

And then uuencoding the resulting archive.

